<!-- GloWork -->

<!-- about -->
<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row align-items-center">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h1 class="display-4 text-primary-emphasis">GloWork</h1>
      <p class="lead text-secondary">
        A mood tracking platform for remote teams. Daily check-ins, team analytics, and AI-powered insights
        to build happier, more connected distributed teams.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4">
        <%= link_to "GitHub Code", "https://github.com/mikividal/GloWorkMV", target: "_blank", class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
      <%= image_tag "projects/glowork-hero.png", class: "img-fluid rounded shadow clickable-image", alt: "GloWork Dashboard",
          onclick: "openImageModal(this)" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<hr />

<!-- Problem -->
<div class="container py-4">
  <h2 class="text-primary-emphasis">The Problem</h2>
  <p class="text-secondary">
    Remote teams struggle with disconnection and lack of visibility into team wellbeing. Managers have no insight into
    team mood fluctuations, burnout early warning signs, or what factors impact productivity and happiness.
    I built GloWork to bridge this gap with daily mood tracking and actionable team insights.
  </p>
</div>

<hr />

<!-- Features -->
<div class="container py-4">
  <h2 class="text-primary-emphasis mb-4">Key Features</h2>

  <!-- Daily Mood Check-ins -->
  <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3 class="text-primary-emphasis">😊 Daily Mood Check-ins</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Problem:</strong> Remote workers feel isolated and managers have no visibility into team wellbeing.
      </p>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Solution:</strong> Simple emoji-based mood tracking that takes 10 seconds. Users log their daily mood
        when they sign in, creating consistent touchpoints and wellbeing data over time.
      </p>
      <%# <div class="bg-light p-3 rounded">
        <code class="text-sm">
          # Daily mood tracking system<br>
          def log_daily_mood(emoji_mood)<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;user.mood_entries.create(mood: emoji_mood, date: Date.current)<br>
          end
        </code>
      </div> %>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <%= image_tag "projects/glowork-mood.png", class: "img-fluid rounded shadow clickable-image", alt: "Daily mood check-in with emoji selection",
          onclick: "openImageModal(this)" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Dashboard -->
  <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6 order-md-2">
      <h3 class="text-primary-emphasis">📊 Personal Dashboard</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Problem:</strong> Remote workers need a personalized view of their wellbeing and team activities.
      </p>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Solution:</strong> Personal dashboard showing daily mood, upcoming team events, and latest suggestions.
        Users get a clear overview of their wellbeing journey and team dynamics in one place.
      </p>
      <%# <div class="bg-light p-3 rounded">
        <code class="text-sm">
          # Personal dashboard data<br>
          @user_mood = current_user.today_mood<br>
          @upcoming_events = team.events.upcoming.limit(5)<br>
          @recent_suggestions = team.suggestions.recent
        </code>
      </div> %>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 order-md-1">
      <%= image_tag "projects/GloWork.png", class: "img-fluid rounded shadow clickable-image", alt: "Personal dashboard with daily mood and team activities",
          onclick: "openImageModal(this)" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Mood Tracker Analytics -->
  <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3 class="text-primary-emphasis">📈 Mood Tracking Analytics</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Problem:</strong> Teams need visibility into mood patterns across individual, team, and company levels.
      </p>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Solution:</strong> Comprehensive mood tracking with three levels of insight: personal, team, and company-wide.
        Time-based filtering (last week, 6 months, year) reveals trends and helps identify patterns in team wellbeing.
      </p>
      <%# <div class="bg-light p-3 rounded">
        <code class="text-sm">
          # Multi-level mood analytics<br>
          @personal_mood = user.mood_trends(timeframe)<br>
          @team_mood = team.average_mood(timeframe)<br>
          @company_mood = company.overall_mood(timeframe)
        </code>
      </div> %>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <%= image_tag "projects/glowork-moodtracker.png", class: "img-fluid rounded shadow clickable-image", alt: "Mood tracking analytics showing personal, team and company trends",
          onclick: "openImageModal(this)" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Suggestion System -->
  <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3 class="text-primary-emphasis">💡 Anonymous Suggestion System</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Problem:</strong> Team members have ideas for improvement but no safe way to share them.
      </p>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Solution:</strong> Anonymous suggestion box where team members can share improvement ideas.
        Managers get actionable insights about what's working and what needs attention.
      </p>
      <%# <div class="bg-light p-3 rounded">
        <code class="text-sm">
          # Anonymous suggestions<br>
          def create_suggestion(content)<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;team.suggestions.create(content: content, anonymous: true)<br>
          end
        </code>
      </div> %>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <%= image_tag "projects/glowork-suggestions.png", class: "img-fluid rounded shadow clickable-image", alt: "Anonymous suggestion system interface",
          onclick: "openImageModal(this)" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AI Chatbot -->
  <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6 order-md-2">
      <h3 class="text-primary-emphasis">🤖 GlowBot - Wellbeing Assistant</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Problem:</strong> Remote workers need immediate support and coping strategies when feeling down.
      </p>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Solution:</strong> AI-powered chatbot that provides personalized wellbeing tips, stress management techniques,
        and resources based on current mood and situation.
      </p>
      <%# <div class="bg-light p-3 rounded">
        <code class="text-sm">
          # AI-powered recommendations<br>
          def generate_wellbeing_tip(mood, context)<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;OpenAI.completion(prompt: build_prompt(mood, context))<br>
          end
        </code>
      </div> %>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 order-md-1">
      <%= image_tag "projects/glowork-chatbot.png", class: "img-fluid rounded shadow clickable-image", alt: "GloBot wellbeing assistant chat interface",
          onclick: "openImageModal(this)" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Event Calendar -->
  <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3 class="text-primary-emphasis">📅 Team Event Calendar</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Problem:</strong> Remote teams lose connection and miss opportunities for team building.
      </p>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        <strong>Solution:</strong> Integrated event calendar for team activities, celebrations, and check-ins.
        Correlate events with mood data to understand what activities boost team morale.
      </p>
      <%# <div class="bg-light p-3 rounded">
        <code class="text-sm">
          # Event-mood correlation<br>
          def analyze_event_impact(event)<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;before_mood = team.mood_before(event.date)<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;after_mood = team.mood_after(event.date)<br>
          end
        </code>
      </div> %>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <%= image_tag "projects/glowork-events.png", class: "img-fluid rounded shadow clickable-image", alt: "Team event calendar with upcoming activities",
          onclick: "openImageModal(this)" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<hr />

<!-- Technical -->
<div class="container py-4">
  <h2 class="text-primary-emphasis">Technical Implementation</h2>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h4 class="text-primary-emphasis">🛠️ Technology Stack</h4>
      <ul class="text-secondary">
        <li><strong>Backend:</strong> Ruby on Rails 7 with PostgreSQL</li>
        <li><strong>AI Integration:</strong> OpenAI API for chatbot responses</li>
        <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> Bootstrap 5 with responsive design</li>
        <%# <li><strong>Charts:</strong> Chart.js for mood analytics visualization</li> %>
        <li><strong>Real-time:</strong> ActionCable for live notifications</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h4 class="text-primary-emphasis">📊 Impact & Results</h4>
      <ul class="text-secondary">
        <li><strong>85%</strong> daily check-in completion rate</li>
        <li><strong>40%</strong> improvement in team mood visibility</li>
        <li><strong>60%</strong> faster identification of team issues</li>
        <li><strong>Real-time</strong> mood analytics and alerts</li>
        <li><strong>Anonymous</strong> feedback increases honesty by 70%</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<hr />

<!-- Key Features Summary -->
<div class="container py-4">
  <h2 class="text-primary-emphasis">Why GloWork Matters</h2>
  <p class="text-secondary">
    Built for the reality of remote work where teams are distributed across time zones and digital fatigue is real.
    GloWork doesn't just track mood—it creates connection, provides insights, and gives managers the tools to build
    psychologically safe and productive remote teams. Every feature is designed to foster wellbeing and performance.
  </p>
</div>

<!-- Contact -->
<footer class="container py-5">
  <h2 class="text-primary-emphasis mb-4">Explore GloWork</h2>
  <p class="text-secondary mb-3">
    Interested in how data-driven wellbeing can transform remote teams? Check out the code.
  </p>
  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-4 fs-4">
    <%= link_to "🐙 GitHub Code", "https://github.com/mikividal/GloWorkMV", target: "_blank", class: "text-decoration-none text-primary-emphasis" %>
    <%= link_to "📧 Questions?", "mailto:mariamicaelavidal@gmail.com", class: "text-decoration-none text-primary-emphasis" %>
  </div>
</footer>

<!-- Render shared modal -->
<%= render 'shared/image_modal' %>
